        "id": "834efb7c"
      },
      "source": [
        "# WGAN-GP Data Augmentation for Rare Emotion Classes\n",
        "\n",
        "This notebook implements a **Wasserstein GAN with Gradient Penalty (WGAN-GP)** for generating synthetic samples of rare emotion classes to balance the dataset.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Key Features:**\n",
        "- Wasserstein loss for stable training\n",
        "- Gradient penalty for Lipschitz constraint\n",
        "- Conditional generation (class-specific)\n",
        "- Mixed precision training for speed\n",
        "\n",
        "**Rare Classes Target:** DISGUST, SURPRISE(< 15% of max class)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "f3c8af77",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "f3c8af77"
      },
      "source": [
        "## Section 1: Monta Google Drive\n",
        "Necessario per leggere il dataset e salvare modelli/output su Drive."
